      "message": "Instead of returning `bool`, make it return an errno. It gives us more flexibility to specify why the access wasn\u0027t permitted.\n\nWith that, -EPERM would be the default not allowed. However, since we sometimes do allow accesses to reg0 to reg3, it would be better to return -EBUSY or -EACCESS if the access is to those registers but it\u0027s _not_ a hypercall exit.",
